# Base URL of the real indexer API — the ORIGIN ONLY, with no /v1 and no
# trailing slash, e.g. https://api.indexer.piggygang.net.
# The version prefix lives in the request path (`/v1/collections`), not here;
# a value ending in /v1 would produce /v1/v1/collections. The client strips one
# and warns rather than 404ing every page, but fix the value.
# Leave it unset and every page serves committed fixture data through the same
# generated client (in-process, no network) — the default, so a fresh clone
# and a zero-config Vercel import work with no environment at all.
# Server-only on purpose: pages fetch in Server Components, so this never
# reaches the browser and the indexer needs no CORS.
API_BASE_URL=
